    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "[`ARMeshGeometry`](armeshgeometry.md) uses geometry-elements to store face data (see [`faces`](armeshgeometry/faces.md)).",
      "ko": "[`ARMeshGeometry`](armeshgeometry.md)는 면 데이터를 저장하기 위해 geometry-elements를 사용합니다(자세한 내용은 [`faces`](armeshgeometry/faces.md) 참조).",
      "sourceHash": "91e4ebaae10c6ad4d165a6da2ba1490ee3f9baa06ef560aefcdf6da4a3c92e15",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "Each face is defined by the primitive type, for example, [`ARGeometryPrimitiveType.triangle`](argeometryprimitivetype/triangle.md).",
      "ko": "각 면은 primitive type으로 정의됩니다. 예를 들어 [`ARGeometryPrimitiveType.triangle`](argeometryprimitivetype/triangle.md)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1f70bd845d84b5763e7a8648fb506a6140f0e3f8b6aebb68ab6b06cf009ea58e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "To demonstrate, an [`ARMeshGeometry`](armeshgeometry.md) instance with two triangle-type faces results in the following configuration:",
      "ko": "예시로, 삼각형 형식의 면 두 개를 가진 [`ARMeshGeometry`](armeshgeometry.md) 인스턴스는 다음 구성으로 표시됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "76f4462e4e41819b3bb6a0d8b34677bc105330a54d720a5042034504398ca232",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "`faces` [`count`](argeometryelement/count.md) `= 2`",
      "ko": "`faces` [`count`](argeometryelement/count.md) `= 2`",
      "sourceHash": "246041485e14fc299fc896060f8c85e9e65ca2a0d582a910ce0eaccfccc5594b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "`faces` [`indexCountPerPrimitive`](argeometryelement/indexcountperprimitive.md) `= 3` (because [`primitiveType`](argeometryelement/primitivetype.md) is [`ARGeometryPrimitiveType.triangle`](argeometryprimitivetype/triangle.md))",
      "ko": "`faces` [`indexCountPerPrimitive`](argeometryelement/indexcountperprimitive.md) `= 3` (because [`primitiveType`](argeometryelement/primitivetype.md) is [`ARGeometryPrimitiveType.triangle`](argeometryprimitivetype/triangle.md))",
      "sourceHash": "5636cf9192cba3e57d3ca5aa2b213ec7f0f1d50f2f55f374797845f2b42ee943",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0010:0003",
      "source": "`faces` [`bytesPerIndex`](argeometryelement/bytesperindex.md) `= 4` (because vertex indices are the type [`UInt32`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/UInt32))",
      "ko": "`faces` [`bytesPerIndex`](argeometryelement/bytesperindex.md) `= 4` (정점 인덱스가 [`UInt32`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/UInt32) 유형이므로)",
      "sourceHash": "f7cb4e833d52885757136ed1962362088a69121886a481d024e3b85300605f29",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0010:0004",
      "source": "The buffer’s total size in bytes `=` [`count`](argeometryelement/count.md) `*` [`indexCountPerPrimitive`](argeometryelement/indexcountperprimitive.md) `*` [`bytesPerIndex`](argeometryelement/bytesperindex.md) (which in this case, is `2 * 3 * 4 = 24` bytes)",
      "ko": "버퍼의 총 바이트 크기 `=` [`count`](argeometryelement/count.md) `*` [`indexCountPerPrimitive`](argeometryelement/indexcountperprimitive.md) `*` [`bytesPerIndex`](argeometryelement/bytesperindex.md) (이 경우 `2 * 3 * 4 = 24` 바이트)",
      "sourceHash": "fb2a6a1767f5d7bd164b53a3a0b3bd60cd06adbf5abe9376cd0562f8d2031dee",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
